window.products.push({"id":488050,"name":"Avalon 24-Piece Silverware Set, High Grade 18/10 Stainless Steel Flatware Set, Service for 6, Mirror Polished Cutlery Set, Dishwasher Safe (Silver)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91AdzaDhMtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Avalon 24-Piece Service for 6 Flatware Set is Premium Silverware that lends an element of dignified elegance to your tabletop. Boasting a bright, hi-luster finish, this complete Avalon Silverware Set includes all the essentials every hostess needs for well-furnished entertaining. Perfect Gift Idea for Your Loved Ones or Yourself The reddish-brown cutlery box looks sleek and stylish which is perfect for gift giving to the people you care about the most. Unique gift idea for Wedding, Birthday, Housewarming, Thanksgiving, Christmas or New Year. A Complete 24-Pieced Silverware Set for 6 People Set includes: 6 STEAK KNIVES, 6 DINNER FORKS, 6 DINNER SPOONS & 6 TEASPOONS. This complete Silverware Set includes all the essential Dinnerware elements every hostess needs for well-furnished entertaining Sturdy & Stylish Made of HIGH QUALITY 18/10 Stainless Steel with a Hi-Luster Finish, this Flatware Set will keep its shine and develop Lustrous Patina for many years to come with proper care. Exquisite Design Ergonomically designed for adults and kids, these utensils have Wide Handle and Smooth Edge which provide great comfort and balance in the hand. Caring for your Stainless-Steel Flatware First time use: Hand wash your new Silverware thoroughly in hot water using a mild soap or detergent. Rinse with fresh water. Dry immediately with a soft cloth. Everyday use: If using a dishwasher, always remember to load forks and spoons handles down, tines and bowls up. Place knives in a separate basket with sharp ends down to prevent scratching and unwanted contact with other alloys. Remove flatware after last rinse cycle and dry by hand. Hot air drying increases the chances of discoloration and corrosion. Do not mix different metals in the same load. Tip: Never soak flatware for long periods or overnight.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91AdzaDhMtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Avalon Silverware","source_asin":"B09H66JSLX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-488050","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H66JSLX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H66JSLX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
