window.products.push({"id":488153,"name":"Electric Deep Fryer with Basket & Lid, 1500W 6L Stainless Steel Commercial Frying Machine, Countertop French Fryer with Temperature Control for Home K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qxYHMCbaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍟【UL CERTIFICATION & HIGH PERFORMANCE】 - Professional grade fryer comes with UL certificate, please purchase with no worrying. And Featured immersed heating element that makes the oil heat faster before and during use. The Adjustable Temperature, Indicator Light, Overload Protection, Overheating Protection and Ground screws button, which let you easily master the art of frying. 🍟【Quick Heating & Adjustable Temperature】 - Our countertop French Fryer design with temperature control function and U-shaped stainless steel heating tubes. Adjustable heat control 60℃ - 200℃(140°F - 392°F). Heating pipe distributes evenly and quickly heat, and the temperature indicator light displays when the fryer is heating the oil. 🍟【SAFE TO USE】 - ①The deep fryer is designed with a temperature limiter which will make the fryer power off automatically when the temperature is over 230℃. ②It's also come with an electric current limiter and ground wire, the oil fryer will power off automatically when the electric current is over 14A for a long time. ③ The deep fryer's edges are folded, so it won't accidentally cut your hands from sharp edges. 🍟【Durable and Easy To Clean】 - The oil fryer features solid construction, made of heavy-duty stainless steel which is for durable use. And the movable oil tank help you pour out the oil more conveniently. Both the detachable fry basket and oil tank are easy to clean. 🍟【Home & Commercial Deep Fryer】 - This Stainless Steel Deep Fryer is durable for both commercial use and home. You can use deep fryer to start your own small business or make restaurant-style appetizers such as french fries, chicken, fish, seafood, mozzarella, vegetables and many more others for the whole family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qxYHMCbaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AKEYDIY","source_asin":"B0C6XGQG65","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-488153","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6XGQG65","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6XGQG65","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
