window.products.push({"id":488199,"name":"Thermos Ultimate 14-Ounce Stainless-Steel Desktop Mug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JJ48RJ3XL._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com Banish the office-coffeepot blahs--bring your own. And here's the thermos to liberate you from the grasp of average taste. Coffee not your cup of tea? Well, any hot or cold beverage fits. Lightweight and virtually unbreakable, the vacuum-insulated thermos offers two secure grips: an ergonomic handle lined with soft, gray rubber and a band of ridged, soft, black rubber encircling its flared, satin-finish body. Tough, nonslip, black plastic protects the top and bottom, while fine threading ensures the twist top seals tightly. A flick of the thumb opens one of the lid's sip-holes (one for righthanders, the other for lefthanders) and closes them to prevent spills and keep the temperature constant. Its twist-off lid and smooth interior clean with sponge or cloth. Preheating or prechilling with hot or cold water is recommended. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JJ48RJ3XL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THERMOS","source_asin":"B00004S1CX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-488199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004S1CX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004S1CX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":488200,"name":"VSUDO 1 Roll 17.7\" by 78.7\" Static Cling Window Film for Privacy, Peony Flower Pattern Window Tint for Home, Window Glass Sticker for Office (9.68 Sq.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UiDU6tBsL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Can we protecting our privacy and keeping the room still bright by natural sunlight? The answer is YES. Our decorative privacy window film can help you to make it happen. Highlight Features: -Protecting privacy and keep home or office bright -Decorate home to be more fashionable -No glue/no adhensive design, static clings to the glass firmly, far away harmful chemicals -Blocking 95% of UV ray away and filtering strong sunlight, prevent furniture from aging and fading -Reusable, ideal for rental places. No residue left on the glass, you can reposition it and reuse Where to use? -The static cling decor window film applies to any smooth glass surface, it can be trimmed or combined to fit any size window. -You can use our window films on windows of living room, bathroom, bedroom, kitchen, and use on front door window, sliding glass door window, glass cabinet panels. This window film fits for office, house, restaurant, bar, shop and home etc. Installation Steps: 1. Cut films to required size, about 1 inch larger than the window 2. Clean the glass surface 3. Use the spray bottle, wet the glass with soapy water or clear water 4. Peel off the back protective film 5. Stick films on glass 6. Use the squeegee to remove the water and air bubbles 7. Trim the margin and cut off the excess edges Package Include: 1 Roll Window Film: 17.7 inch By 78.7 inch (45 X 200CM) Tips: 1. This product is only suitable for smooth, flat and clean glass surface.Do not use on rough, uneven, frosted glass or other materials. 2. Please make sure to peel off the backing film before applying and apply the smooth side of film to glass. Otherwise it will not be firmly adhered. 3. This window film can show the colors perfectly just when the light is going through or reflected, so usually you can’t see the colors of window film before installation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UiDU6tBsL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VSUDO","source_asin":"B082DJPYJX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-488200","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082DJPYJX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082DJPYJX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
