window.products.push({"id":488501,"name":"Oabry Three Dimensional Embossed Pack of 2 Decorative Throw Pillow Covers 18x18 Inch Yellow Brown Plush Velvet Cushion Throw Pillow Case for Sofa Car ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IBEhdxqcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Cross Embossing Pillow] This is a handmade seamless throw pillow cover.Use Three dimensional cross embossing.The material is 100% environmentally friendly velvet fabric,very soft and comfortable. Same design and color on both sides.Decorative throw pillow cover is a combination of bedding and sofa. [About size] The throw pillowcase measures 16x16 inch (40 cm x 40 cm) and 18x18 inch (45 cm x 45 cm). Please note: This size is the size of the pillowcase. It can hold 20x20 inch, 18x18 inch, 16x16 inch rectangular sofa throw pillow insert. We recommend that you use a larger pillow insert than the throw pillowcase and make it fuller when installed. Use the same size pillow insert and the pillow cover looks unsatisfactory after installation. [Available in a variety of environments] Provide a lumbar pad for your patio or outdoor sofa set. Pillows from small to large can be used in indoor or outdoor hammocks or on sofas, suitable for use at home or in sets for picnic seating in fine weather conditions. Ideal for outdoor summer travel, it is holiday spa, family outdoor throw pillow covers. [Washing and maintenance] Wash gently, the highest water temperature 30 and the soaking time shall not exceed 8 minutes; can not be chlorine bleached;dry cleaning; medium temperature ironing; do not Contact sharps or forcefully pull; do not wash with colored or faded clothing Decorative throw pillow cover should be placed in a dry and ventilated place to dry,not in a damp place. [About color difference] Since the shooting angle and light will be different, there may be some color difference between the picture and the product, which is not a quality problem. The handmade pillow cover may have a 1-2cm error.If you have any questions,please write emall to us，We will try our best to help you. It's OK to refund or send a new product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IBEhdxqcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oabry","source_asin":"B0814CGYD9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-488501","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0814CGYD9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0814CGYD9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
