window.products.push({"id":488584,"name":"65-Piece Heavy Duty Silverware Set with Serving Utensils, HaWare Stainless Steel Flatware Cutlery Set for 12, Fancy Tableware Eating Utensils with Thi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WSq4sZgWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【65-PIECE SILVERWATE SET FOR 12】 Comes with 12 dinner forks, 12 dinner spoons, 12 dinner knives, 12 teaspoons and 12 dessert forks plus a set of serving utensils including 1 pie server, 1 butter knife, 1 serving spoon, 1 serving fork, 1 slotted spoon ideal for everyday use, party, home, kitchen, hotel, restaurant serving and more 【HEAVY DUTY MATERIAL】Made of high quality 18/0 stainless steel which is food grade material has proper weight, solid structure, Sturdy and thick enough for heavy use, No harmful substances, nickel free, Great at rust resistant and durable for years to come, Dishwasher safe 【CLASSIC BUT UNIQUE DESIGN】Classic for square handle, Smooth edge, Matte finish craftwork, Simple streamlined design helps you hold comfortably, Unique for triple polygon lines and delicate engraved pattern, Highly improve your dinner experience, Elegant appearance also matches most styles of tableware and kitchens 【EXTRA SERVING UTENSILS】5-Piece hostess serving utensils not only meet any needs in different occasions, but also ideal for EGG SPEARATING, BUTTER SIFTING, FRUIT SCOOPING and etc, These functional utensils are bender-resistant and durable for long time usage, Make serving salads, fruit, dessert, steak and more food easy 【IDEAL FOR GIFT】Exquisite tableware set as a great gift can be offered to your family, friends in some special day like Easter Day, Mother's day, Housewarming also suit for some occasions like Wedding, Party, Meet all dinning needs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WSq4sZgWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HaWare","source_asin":"B0BG6Y169L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-488584","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG6Y169L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG6Y169L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":488585,"name":"Silver Gilt Handmade Evil Eye Turkish Greek Glass Charm Decorative Ornament for Good Luck, Success and Protection (2.7 inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IcexAF29L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Throughout the whole human history, in every culture and religion, the eye figure has been considered as a powerful talisman to defy evil forces... We find this figure in Jewish, Christian and Muslim cultures as well as Buddhist and Hindu societies. This common tradition finds a new identity in the 3000 years old glass craftsmanship of Anatolia. A glass master combines the power of the eye figure with the power of the fire and creates a new talisman: THE EVIL EYE BEAD. It is believed that the Evil Eye deflects the negative energy that is being directed towards a person onto itself, thus dispersing its powers. The Evil Eye is blue in color and the age-old Anatolian belief is that it is actually the blue color of the stone, which holds the real shielding power and absorbs the negative energy. That is why; front doors of houses in these Mediterranean countries are painted blue to ward off evil spirits. The evil eye pendant is attached to anything and everything that, it is felt, will attract envy and greed. Thus, you will find a Turkish man attaching the evil eye pendant in front of his house or office, hanging it from the neck of his newborn child, or his farm animals and even on his newly acquired machinery. In Hebrew Evil Eye is called \"ayin ha'ra\". In mainland Italian it is \"mal occhio\" ( the bad eye ) and in Spanish \"mal ojo\" or \"el ojo\" ( the bad eye or just the eye ). In Sicily it is \"jettatore\" ( the protection from the eye ) and in Farsi it is \"bla band\" ( the eye of evil ). The Evil Eye is also known as \"ayin harsha\" in Arabic, \"droch shuil\" in Scotland, \"mauvais oeil\" in France, \"büsen Blick\" in Germany and was known as \"oculus malus\" among the classical Romans. So the idea is to protect yourself, your house, your office or the beloved ones.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IcexAF29L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ebsem","source_asin":"B07547WYM3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-488585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07547WYM3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07547WYM3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":488586,"name":"YIROCK Gold Plastic Cups (100-Count) 9 oz. Clear Party Tumblers for Business, Holiday, Birthday, or Wedding Events | Disposable, Recyclable, Ecofriend","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xf5LBc0dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enhance your guests’ drinking experience with gold-rimmed party glasses designed specifically for elegant luxury! When it comes to hosting a great party, be it a holiday event, special birthday, or business gathering, the details are what make it memorable; especially when it comes to serving beverages. That’s why we created Fabduction Gold-Rimmed Plastic Cups that are just the right size for cocktails, sodas, punch, and more. And because they feature a unique shape, stable base, and elegant gold rim surrounding the top, they not only highlight the liquid inside they create a style that’s truly unforgettable. Crafted with food-grade safe plastic that’s recyclable and ecofriendly, add these to your next event to truly set the tone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xf5LBc0dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fabduction","source_asin":"B07GLWPZLW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-488586","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GLWPZLW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GLWPZLW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
