window.products.push({"id":488598,"name":"Joewisen Tiger Statue Chinese Tiger Zodiac Figurine Feng Shui Decor, Golden Resin Dog Collectible Figurines Including A Calabash (Wu Lou) for Good Luc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91sfDLIQKZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Chinese animal zodiac tiger figurine, or shengxiao (born resembling), is a repeating cycle of 12 years, with each year being represented by an animal and its reputed attributes. Traditionally these zodiac animals were used to date the years.In order, the 12 animals are: Rat, Ox, Tiger, Rabbit, Dragon, Snake, Horse, Goat, Monkey, Rooster, Dog, Pig. People in ancient China often Keep tiger statue in their home as ornaments or family decoration for the reason that the tiger can ward off evil spirits. 2022 is known in China as the Year of the Tiger, especially with the recession and unemployment in these years, maybe this tiger collectible figurines will bring you good luck in life. What’s in the package: There are 1 pcs Chinese Tiger Zodiac Figurine and 1 pcs Feng Shui calabash (Wu Lou) , the gourd (wu lou) can be unscrewed, and inside there contains a note with a massage that wishing you a good luck, fortune, good health and a long life. It can also be sent to your friends/lovers/family as a gift or souvenir, elegant home office decoration, collection Figurines statues of gifts. DECORATING: This is a perfect household item that can be placed in the bedroom, home and also office, which will help you attract wealth and prosperity, success and all the good things. Put it in the living room to bring you good luck. Tiger represents auspiciousness with functions of protecting houses, warding off an evil influence. And the Wu Lou (calabash) in its original form is a fruit and when dried was traditionally applied to store water which is how it got its name “giver of life”. When these two objects are put together, they can bring you: Good Luck, Fortune, Longevity and Wealth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91sfDLIQKZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joewisen","source_asin":"B09QM3STZX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-488598","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QM3STZX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QM3STZX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
