window.products.push({"id":488620,"name":"Funny Mug For Introvert Anti Social People Its Way Too Peopley Outside Gift Cup 11 oz White Ceramic Mugs Sarcastic Personal Mug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BqXmyht8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ultimate Gift Mug that Stands Out from the Rest: Give a gift that creates a lasting impression. Your co worker, boss, colleague, manager, or office mate who is an introvert can now enjoy their favorite coffee drinks and other beverages with this funny and hilarious mug designed to send smiles and love. Trust us, you'll not only want to get this for your family or friends but also for yourself if you believe you don’t usually enjoy a crowd. Premium Ceramic Coffee Mug: This high-quality 11oz ceramic white mug has a premium hard coat that provides crisp and vibrant color reproduction sure to last for years. Printed on both sides for either left or right-handed person so the awesome message and art will be visible. High-gloss and has a premium white finish that can make you enjoy your drink more. Can also be used as pen holders on your office work table, planter for your kitchen herb, jewelry holder, or serving your favorite dessert. Relatable Humorous Quote: Why settle for a boring old mug when you can have this one-of-a-kind drinkware on your dining, kitchen, or work table? Bring a smile to your loved ones' faces with this hilarious mug. Featuring a witty and relatable quote, this mug is sure to brighten anyone's day. Whether you're enjoying your morning coffee or taking a well-deserved break at work, this mug is the perfect pick-me-up. A conversation starter, it's also a surefire way to lift anyone's mood. Hilarious and Quirky Gift Mug: It's not just the functional aspects that make this mug stand out. Its humorous design is what makes it a truly special and memorable gift. Whether it's to celebrate birthdays, anniversaries, graduation, holidays, retirement, Christmas, or any special milestone that occurs in life, this mug is sure to bring a smile to their face and some laughter to their day. The perfect present for anyone who loves a good laugh! Dishwasher and Microwave Safe: These fantastic drinking mugs can go straight in the dishwasher, all day every day, meaning it can save you time, and be more hygienic. Perfect for your favorite hot or cold beverages. Easily reheat that coffee or tea you forgot to drink right away because it is microwave safe. Saves you time, is very convenient, and is perfect for your busy lifestyle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BqXmyht8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panvola","source_asin":"B0BQY3SB78","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-488620","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQY3SB78","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQY3SB78","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":488621,"name":"Lehman's Mehu-Maija 11 Qt Steam Juicer, Stainless Steel with Lid, Hose, Clamp, Loop Handles, Multipot Cookware for Making Juices, Jelly, Sauces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YPHiNkCiL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The No-Work Method for Making Juice Concentrate and Wine! Make delicious artisanal batches of wine and juices right at home on your stovetop - what could be better than that?! Drop fruit in top chamber (grapes on the stem, apple quarters, whole berries), then fill bottom chamber with water and boil. The juice concentrate collects in the center chamber. Empty your juice into a glass to enjoy right away or store it for a special event using the included drain hose and clamp. Holds 11 qt. New leak-proof spout design. Works on any stove, including induction. Comes with glass lid for easy monitoring. Stay cool welded handles. 18/8 stainless steel. 14\"H x 11-5/8\"OD. 8-1/4 lb. Item includes: Glass Lid. Fruit Basket: 5-1/2\"H x 11-5/8\"OD. Juice Kettle: 5-5/8\"H x 11-5/8\"OD. Water Kettle: 5-5/8\"H x 11-5/8\"OD. Drain Hose: 17\"L x 1/2\"OD. Drain Clamp: 3-1/2\"L x 2-3/8\"W.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YPHiNkCiL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lehman's","source_asin":"B07CZPDDJ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-488621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CZPDDJ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CZPDDJ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":488622,"name":"2 Silicone mold egg bites large thick and steamer rack with handles | 6 & 8 qt instant pot & pressure cooker accessory | Reusable food storage & freez","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rFD0Zl9kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"-TOP QUALITY AND ENVIRONMENTALLY SAFE PRODUCTS: 2 large, thick, 100% silicone egg mold bites each with 7 individual portions, 2 silicone lids, 1 spoon are food grade safe, BPA and toxin free silicone, 100% safe. They are completely silicone and will pass the pitch test. The pinch test is how to determine if a silicone product completely silicone. If is shows white, there are other materials mixed in with the silicone, which can leave residue in the food that is cooked in it. If no color change, it is 100% silicone. Durable, thicker and larger than most other silicone egg bite molds. Our product weighs 225 grams and are 21.5 cm/8.46 inches in diameter, while most others brands are a flimsy 180 grams and 15.8 cm/6.25 inches in diameter. The rack with handles are stainless steel and designed for cooking. -MULTIPURPOSE: Can make egg bites like Starbucks. Designed for cooking all meats and vegetables, poaching eggs, baking desserts, popsicles and any frozen foods. Baby food cooking and serving meals. Food storage and food freezing. Lunch to go packing. Meal prepping for the week. -EASY TO USE: Steamer rack with handles makes it easy to set in and take out one or stack both egg bite molds into 6 & 8 qt pressure cookers and instant pots. The steamer rack can also be used to cool food and specifically designed to hold eggs. Easy clean up, with cooking spray almost zero food residue after cooking. Dishwasher safe or can be hand washed. Silicone molds and silicone lids can be frozen and used to cook up to 450 degrees. Microwave safe. -FREE RECIPE E-BOOK: Over 25 recipes from main courses, vegetarian, sides dishes, and desserts specifically for egg bite molds. Due to Amazon's policy, any buyer that opts out of emails from sellers blocks the automatic ebook email after purchase of the product. If you opt out of seller emails, simply email us on Amazon or directly at greencleanproducts.inc@gmail.com with your order number and we will email you recipe e-book within 1-5 bu","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rFD0Zl9kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Green Clean Products","source_asin":"B07SPT6QRT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-488622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SPT6QRT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SPT6QRT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
