window.products.push({"id":488669,"name":"Zulay Kitchen (3-Piece Set) Cutting Boards For Kitchen Dishwasher Safe - Plastic Cutting Board Set - Non Slip Kitchen Cutting Board With Juice Groove ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XMsdp4qfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DURABLE AND STURDY: This 3-piece cutting board set is made of thick, non-porous material that makes it strong enough to withstand chopping when using a sharp knife without cracks or peels. These chopping boards will be your lifelong partner in helping you efficiently prep food. NON-SLIP, REVERSIBLE DESIGN: Chop, cut, slice, or dice using these plastic cutting boards that will surely stay in place during meal prep. The non-slip rubber border and the handle keep the cutting board from slipping and sliding over the counter even when chopping through the toughest ingredients. Use both sides without worrying about mixing flavors and contaminating your food. MESS-FREE COOKING EXPERIENCE: Eliminate the hassle of cleaning after a fun cooking session by using our cutting board with juice grooves. All sides of the boards are designed with grooves to catch the juices from meat, fruits, or vegetables, keeping your kitchen countertop squeaky clean during food prep. MULTIPLE SIZES FOR EVERY TYPE OF FOOD: Cut or chop your ingredients separately by choosing the right size from our chopping board set; small: 11.8 x 8 inches, medium: 13.8 x 9.6 inches, large: 16 x 11.2 inches, each with a thickness of 0.31 inches. Slice fruits, chop fresh herbs, or cut raw or cooked meat efficiently with our must-have kitchen accessories. EASY TO CLEAN: The material of these meat cutting boards allows maintaining hygiene super simple by not absorbing the odor from food. Just toss these in the dishwasher to clean away all the leftover juices from the food. You can also clean it by running the chopping board under water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XMsdp4qfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zulay Kitchen","source_asin":"B0B9V3J73M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-488669","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9V3J73M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9V3J73M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
