window.products.push({"id":488687,"name":"Art Studio Company Hand Painted Glass Christmas Ornament - Whale Tail Alaska","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81d7LDwoZsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Alaska like you’ve never seen it before. This beautiful, reverse-painted glass ornament shows the whales of Alaska in full 360 degrees. It continues an ancient art-form prized by collectors. The artists choosing from a selection of miniature curved and bent-shafted brushes, painstakingly hand paints every minute detail on the inside of the ornament. The craft requires the artists to repeatedly insert the brush through the small opening in the sphere; first to outline the design, and then to detail the colors one by one. The entire process for each ornament requires up to two days. No two pieces are identical, making this inside-painted glass ornament a keepsake to be treasured from generation to generation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81d7LDwoZsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Art Studio Company","source_asin":"B07VHZVH4M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-488687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VHZVH4M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VHZVH4M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":488688,"name":"Santa Snow Globe, Christmas Snow Globes Lantern Glitter Lighted with Music, Christmas Decorations and Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+ZFl2p+ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎅【Wonderful Christmas Decorations】Want to spice up your Christmas? Choose it. The snow globe is designed with the vintage bronze frame, Santa Claus interiors, a small portable handle. Perfect size for any occasion, desktop, fireplace, centerpieces or hanging. Classic elegant shape design brings a touch of retro style and a strong Christmas atmosphere to your home. 🎅【Cycle 8 Christmas Songs】Santa snow globe has two modes,①Lighted ②Lighted with music, the glitter will swirl around the inside automatically with the soft light. When you choose mode2, it cycle plays 8 Christmas songs, Jingle Bells, We Wish You A Merry Christmas, Silent Night, Deck The Halls, Joy To The World, The First Noel, Hark! The Herald Angel Sing, Oh, Christmas Tree. 🎅【6H Timer Mode】Two modes have 6H Timer. It allows the Christmas lantern ON for 6 hours and OFF for 18 hours, cycle every 24 hours, and will light on automatically at the same time next day. Every day it will light up on time, bringing you a merry Christmas atmosphere. it is the perfect choice for a night light, which gives off a soft glow, and do not worry about forgetting to turn it off. 🎅【Optional Charging Ways】The snowglobe comes with the USB cable,you can charge by USB cable. It is also powered by 3 AA batteries (Not Included). It allows you to put it wherever you want to decorate, indoors or outdoors. Such as tabletop, centerpieces, Xmas tree, wall, door, nightstand, patio, porch, or the party scene. 🎅【Perfect Christmas Gift】No one can say no to such a Christmas gift that gives a soft light and plays beautiful music! Moreover, we provide exquisite Christmas gift box packaging. It is a sweet holiday gift to be given to your friends or families. The Santa Cluas in the soft light, while the glittering sequins are constantly rotating, create a fairytale Christmas atmosphere, which is so Eye-Catching.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+ZFl2p+ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eyrosa","source_asin":"B09CP7T4JV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-488688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CP7T4JV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CP7T4JV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
