window.products.push({"id":488775,"name":"West Bend 41200 Programmable Bread Machine, Stainless (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41QX3KGnEeL._AC_.jpg","description":"Wake up to the smell of freshly baked bread with this programmable bread machine. Simply add the ingredients, choose from several options using the touch-pad controls, and it takes care of the rest. It will mix the ingredients, knead the dough, let it rise, and bake it to perfection--soft on the inside and crispy on the outside. Choose from 1-, 1-1/2-, and 2-pound sizes and three crust settings--light, medium, or dark. Once the baking has completed, the machine switches to a one-hour keep-warm cycle that keeps bread warm without over-cooking. The unit's 12 program settings include basic, French, whole wheat, sweet, quick, brown, and super rapid for 1-1/2- and 2-pound loaves, plus dough, bagel dough, jam, and bake settings. Other highlights include delay start, an audible alert for adding \"extras\", a viewing window, an easy-to-read blue backlit LCD control panel, and a non-stick pan for effortless loaf removal and quick clean-up. Recipes come included. Attractively housed in durable stainless steel, the 490-watt bread machine measures 13-1/2 by 12-1/2 by 11-1/2 inches and carries a one-year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41QX3KGnEeL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"West Bend","source_asin":"B000TK8SN2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-488775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000TK8SN2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000TK8SN2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":488776,"name":"Giantex 360 Degree Swivel Gaming Chair Floor Chair, 6 Positions Adjustable Backrest, Mesh Fabric, Sturdy Iron Frame, Foldable Lazy Sofa Chair Comforta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LzMnfWGjL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【6-Position Adjustment & 360° Swivel】: The floor chair is designed with adjustable 6-position backrest to fulfill different individual requirements. Adjust the backrest to your desired Angle with ease, which only need you to exert your body pressure on it. More, 360° swivel base brings much more convenience in turning around your body for added fun. 【Ergonomic Design to Relax Your Body】: High backrest is capable of providing comfortable support to your tired body, relieving your back muscle fatigue and enabling a better relaxation. Compared with armless floor chair, it delicately equipped with armrest shall take the comfortableness to the next level. Also, it will perfectly fit well with your body curve thanks to its ergonomic design. 【Fold it for Easy & Spacing-Saving Storage】: The folding floor gaming chair without any required assembly allows you to use it once you receive the package. Additionally, when not in use, it can be folded easily for a space-saving storage. In this way, those who want to keep a neat living space or lack storage space will benefit a lot. 【Breathable Mesh Fabric & Soft Sponge】: The mesh fabric features excellent breathability and soft tactility, that’s why this lazy soft chair adopts such material instead of others. Plus, filled with premium high resilience sponge inside, it is not easy to sag while avoid discomfort even sitting there for long time. 【Wide Applications in Daily Life】: whether for playing mobile games, concentrating on reading a loved books or having meditation, the floor rocker chair will extremely satisfy you. Besides, it can be used as a leisure chair as well, to entertain family members and guests who get used to sitting on the floor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LzMnfWGjL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Giantex","source_asin":"B08C2VZ9VS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-488776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C2VZ9VS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C2VZ9VS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
