window.products.push({"id":488853,"name":"BELLE CHANTE Luxury Cotton Napkins | 20 x 20 inches, One Dozen, Bronze","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.18,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6196JCpthjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Natural Responsibly-farmed Sustainable Cotton THE MOST LUXURIOUS - The Belle Chante name stands for true luxury and superior performance. Our fine napkin sets are woven with cutting-edge air jet looms, which enables a tighter weave, more satisfying heft, softer texture and immaculate finish. They are large, extra absorbent, strong, durable and ready to entertain. From the moment you first touch our fine cotton napkin sets, you will know you have purchased the very best! IMPRESS YOUR GUESTS with Belle Chante's elegant table napkins! Each cloth napkin is a statement of sophisticated taste, perfect for Thanksgiving, Christmas and Easter, summer weddings, anniversary, baby shower, fall banquet events and restaurant or hotel use. Belle Chante napkins arrive in a complementary presentation box, ready to be monogrammed or embroidered, perfect for craft painting, vinyl transfer and creative tie-die projects, or to give as a beautiful and reusable gift! YOUR KITCHEN SAYS A LOT ABOUT YOU - Belle Chante's exclusive DESIGNER COLOR PALETTE pairs perfectly and complements your fine taste in cooking, wine, and eco friendly home decor. From French country house to modern linen, from rustic farm house pantry to pioneer table or boho, they will look beautiful indoor or out, on your table, charger, serving platter, hearth or anywhere in your home! VISIBLY BETTER - Enjoy vintage, finely-tailored woven and fully hemstitched construction with each corner mitered flat and square. They can be machine washed hundreds of times, and yet remain super soft, extremely absorbent, and totally lint free. They will not scratch delicate surfaces, and they are extra absorbent to completely protect your guests' clothing from accidental spills, stains and lint. FEEL GOOD ABOUT YOUR CHOICES - Belle Chante fine dining napkins are made from some of the finest 100% natural, responsibly-farmed, renewable and sustainable cotton available anywhere in the world. They are free of harsh or harmful chemicals, contain no synthetic material, and each one can help save dozens or even hundreds of trees by replacing the need for paper towels and other paper-based products. We invite you to join us in our commitment to respect and preserve our environment!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6196JCpthjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BELLE CHANTE","source_asin":"B08KGWX7CC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-488853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KGWX7CC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KGWX7CC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
