window.products.push({"id":488953,"name":"Ovente KS93R Stainless Steel Cordless Electric Kettle, 1.7-Liter, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t0ndVwf8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Ovente KS93R red is a high class brushed stainless steel design electric kettle that looks great on any kitchen or countertops. With 1.7 liter water capacity and 1500-watt of power -- this electric kettle can quickly bring water to a rolling boil. It is proven to be 85 percent more efficient than stovetop kettle that can reduce your daily electricity use. This kettle lifts from the corded base for a cordless filling, pouring and graceful serving. The kettle has a concealed water heating element, so there is no buildup of objectionable mineral deposits, flip-back lid for convenient filling or cleaning and non-drip spout. For safety purposes, this kettle is equipped with automatic shut-off, boil-dry protection, secure locking lid, power on indicator light, cool touch button and comfortable stay-cool handle. The 360-degree swivel power base comes with a 30-inch cord that wraps neatly into the base for easy storage. Kettle approximately measures 6.2 x 6.2 x 8.9 Inch; base measures 7 x 7 x 0.75 Inch. It comes with 1-year limited manufacturer warranty. To use the kettle, simply fill it with water at the sink up to desired amount using the water-level indicator, return the kettle to its 360-degree swivel power base, put it in and push the steam switch down. This kettle heats fast, approximately 5-6 minutes (at maximum level) and delivers boiling water almost instantly, in a matter of minutes hot water will be ready to use for instant coffee, tea, hot cereal, oatmeal or even a box of macaroni. For more information about proper handling, cleaning of kettle Please refer to the instruction manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t0ndVwf8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OVENTE","source_asin":"B008CQI4CK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-488953","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008CQI4CK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008CQI4CK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
